    "Name": "Dagoth",
    "Details": "VEST analyzers predicted a market for a more advanced version after the DG-P-7 proved its worth as a Periphery export, so VEST launched the DG-P-9. A switch to double heat sinks let it upgrade to extended-range Large Lasers and add a second LRM-10. In the end, even though it was capable it proved too costly, it found few takers among Periphery states long used to buying cheap.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Well Balanced</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.17</color></b>",
